From: OpenIPC Buildroot integration <build@openipc.org>
Subject: [PATCH] fix halrf_cmn_info_hook prototype

Keep the header prototype in sync with the implementation.  GCC warns
about the enum/integer mismatch, and this kernel build treats that
warning as an error.

--- a/hal/phydm/halrf/halrf.h
+++ b/hal/phydm/halrf/halrf.h
@@ -216 +216 @@ halrf_cmn_info_hook(
-	u32		cmn_info,
+	enum halrf_cmninfo_hook_e	cmn_info,
